{{Short description|None}}
This is a [[Bar chart|graphical]] '''timeline of prime ministers of Great Britain and the United Kingdom''' from when the first [[Prime Minister of the United Kingdom|prime minister]] of [[Kingdom of Great Britain|Great Britain]] in the modern sense, [[Robert Walpole]], took office in 1721, until the present day.

From 1801 until 1922, British prime ministers also held the office for the whole of Ireland.

